    "finalName": "",
    "description": "A number of times per encounter equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier (minimum 1), your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> gain a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> that can be used as normal. Additionally, your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> gain a number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained_Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained Skills\">Trained Skills</a> equal to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> score, and may take regular <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a> instead of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Follower_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Follower Actions\">Follower Actions</a> (you still must spend the equivalent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a> for your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a>).",
